msgctxt "database"
msgid "Ships"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/science_db.lua:292
msgid ""
"Spaceships are vessels capable of withstanding the dangers of travel through "
"deep space. They can fill many functions and vary broadly in size, from "
"small tugs to massive dreadnoughts."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/science_db.lua:294
msgctxt "database"
msgid "Stations"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/science_db.lua:295
msgid ""
"Space stations are permanent, immobile structures ranging in scale from "
"small outposts to city-sized communities. Many provide restocking and repair "
"services to neutral and friendly ships."
msgstr ""

